{"items":[{"str":"often because the politics were too clear or the message too extreme.","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"This is mostly true for representations that are oppositional, that is,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,635],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"representations that take an unpopular stand against widely held be-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"liefs or political positions in the culture.","dir":"ltr","width":182,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,326,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"7","dir":"ltr","width":4,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,327,610],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[7,0,0,7,330,610],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"This also explains why it is","dir":"ltr","width":122,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,334,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"still possible to make very racist or sexist movies: there is still enough","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,593],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"of a constituency to support such representations in the culture, and","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,579],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the people targeted do not yet have enough visibility or voice to chal-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"lenge the representations in question. What, then, are popular cul-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ture’s possibilities for challenging the social order? What limits these","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"possibilities, and why?","dir":"ltr","width":98,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"As Stuart Hall argues, cultural studies “has to analyze certain things","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,509],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"about the constitutive and political nature of representation itself,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,495],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"about its complexities, about the effects of language, about textuality","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,481],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"as a site of life and death.”","dir":"ltr","width":119,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,263,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"8","dir":"ltr","width":4,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,263,470],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[7,0,0,7,267,470],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"By “the constitutive nature of representa-","dir":"ltr","width":186,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,270,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tion” he means the way representations (visual, aural, verbal, etc.) ac-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tually construct their object, so that rather than talking about good or","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,439],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"bad images of something that exists “out there” in its true or authen-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,425],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tic state, we need to talk about how an image constructs what it is rep-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"resenting. We have to pretend, in a way, that we do not know what","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"that object is (a lesbian, for example, in a film such as","dir":"ltr","width":242,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,386,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Basic Instinct","dir":"ltr","width":59,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,390,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"),","dir":"ltr","width":7,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,449,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"and we must ask, how does this representation construct lesbian iden-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,369],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tity? The political nature of representation may be a clearer concept to","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,355],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"grasp: how, for example, do representations affect the lives of the peo-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ple and situations they represent? How do they influence decision","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"making about their subject matter? (Take the","dir":"ltr","width":200,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,344,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Murphy Brown","dir":"ltr","width":65,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,347,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,412,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"show, for","dir":"ltr","width":41,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,415,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"example; or","dir":"ltr","width":52,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,196,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"The Silence of the Lambs","dir":"ltr","width":105,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,199,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"—how does this representation of","dir":"ltr","width":151,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,305,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"a pseudo-","dir":"ltr","width":43,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"transsexual","dir":"ltr","width":53,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,188,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,240,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":"man influence the politics of queer struggle for","dir":"ltr","width":212,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,244,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"rights and recognition?)","dir":"ltr","width":107,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"This project is also about changing our position as “mere” con-","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"sumers of mass culture and making us into critics, meaning that we","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,243],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"approach our culture critically and we analyze it, not only in order","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,229],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"to denounce it, but in order to understand the ways it works on","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,215],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"us, the ways we are implicated in it. It is about understanding how","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"our culture represents us and how we are represented in it. Thus, this","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"kind of analysis also always involves locating oneself as analyst: what is","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"your subject position; how are you situated in relation to it and by it","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,159],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"(how does it situate a person as consumer, reader, viewer, participant,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 17 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f1":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.72,"descent":-0.245,"vertical":false}},"lang":null}